    "forecast": "high",
    "rationale": "Present risk is a property finding: the design performs consequential production actions, including irreversible database migrations, using the engineer's personal token while recording those actions only under the engineer's name. The only linking record is deletable chat history, so attributable provenance is missing. Under rubric section 5a this is an S3 property finding on consequential capabilities, giving inherent high and no residual reduction because no declared control restores the missing property. Manual validation applied because scripts could not be run."
